        "raw": "<p>Rod of Anubis and Overdrive!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Did you know it works this way?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Rod of Anubis in Mr. Fixer&#39;s play area, Mr. Fixer plays Overdrive, which allows Mr. Fixer to use his &#39;Strike&#39; power twice this turn. Then, in the power phase, Mr. Fixer used the Rod of Anubis. Afterwards, he can still use &#39;Strike&#39; twice!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Combined with Dual Crowbars and Grease Monkey Fist, Mr. Fixer wiped out the remaining members of the Ennead, doing six shots of damage for a total of 29 HP.</p>",
